<title>NETHERLANDS: Wegener to buy stake in multimedia firms.</title>
<headline>Wegener to buy stake in multimedia firms.</headline>
<dateline>APELDOORN, Netherlands 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wegener Arcade NV said on Tuesday its Arcade Music Group subsidiary was seeking to acquire a substantial minority stake in multi-media design company M-Design BV and entertainment group DCP Holding.  </p>
<p>M-Design is a multi-media design studio, specialised in the music and events sector and employs eight people in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>Wegener Arcade said the eyed participation meant a strengthening of the already existing cooperation between Arcade Music group and ID&amp;T and M-Design.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
